    <h2>The honest math</h2>
    <p>If your average job value is $500 and a custom site converts even one extra visitor a week into a call, that is $26,000 of additional pipeline a year. If your average job is $5,000, the math is an order of magnitude bigger. <strong>"Good enough" is a trap because it tells you nothing &mdash; it cannot rank #1 in your local pack, it cannot win the click against a sharper competitor, and the leads it does not generate never appear on a bill anywhere.</strong></p>
